<div class="content-card">

    <h2>System Overview</h2>

    <p>
        The ACMCL Automated Voting & Tally System
        is designed to make student council elections
        faster, more organized, and more efficient.
    </p>

    <h2>Objectives</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Provide convenient online voting.</li>
        <li>Reduce manual vote-counting errors.</li>
        <li>Provide accurate election results.</li>
        <li>Protect voter information.</li>
        <li>Prevent duplicate voting.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Developed For</h2>

    <p>Ark of the Covenant Montessori Chamber of Learning (ACMCL)</p>

</div>